	(descr "Sockets for an ESP32-S3-DevKitC-1 compatible development board: 1x22 pins, 2.54 mm pitch. The J3 row is doubled, so the footprint takes boards with 25.40 mm (YD-ESP32-S3 style, 27.94 mm wide) or 22.86 mm (Espressif, 25.40 mm wide) between rows.")
